# Native projects generated by expo prebuild (CNG — EAS Build runs prebuild on the server).
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose: an unanchored `android/` also matches
# `modules/*/android/`, which would silently drop the source of every local
# module from the commit (the module would still autolink, minus its Kotlin).
/android/
/ios/

# Gradle output of a local module (source is tracked, generated output is not).
# Kept narrower than a bare `build/`, which could match real directories.
modules/*/android/build/

# Editor swap files
*.swp
*~
